MerkleAccount root acceptance
├── owner disables a root while the registry still publishes it
│   ├── stores zero and emits AcceptRoot
│   ├── rejects previously authorized Merkle proofs
│   └── permits restoring the exact published root
├── non-owner attempts to disable the root
│   └── reverts without changing the active root
└── owner accepts a nonzero unpublished root
    └── reverts without changing the active root
